        m_Value: 11
    - rid: 8910043418339311998
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: A week has passed and the dead are already in the thousands. We
          have yet to find anything that could present a cure. Keepers walk the street
          with carts to carry the bodies. Cremation seems to be the most viable option,
          we allow ourselves an hour of study before burning them, it has been our
          only current fail safe to prevent further spread of the disease.\n\n  
          We have been documenting the difference in the manner this sickness presents
          itself. The first man had clusters of hands growing on and inside him,
    - rid: 8910043418339311999
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
    - rid: 8910043418339312005
      type: {class: UserNodeModelImp, ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor.Implementation, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor}
