    - rid: 8910043418339312196
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: The Veil abolished this, it protected us from their utterances.
          The afflicted are unfaithful. They turned their backs on the Veil and lost
          its protection. Such was the Makers' wisdom.\n\n  He addressed the public
          with this information, faith in the Veil will protect them and they need
          it now more than ever. For now we continue administering fluids to the
          afflicted, as the Maker instructed, he will find a solution for the non
          believers soon.
