    - rid: 8910043462656589943
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "The Maker found his solution and enacted it today. Keepers took
          the afflicted, alive or dead and burned them. I have noted previously that
          cremation was our most viable method to stop this scourge from spreading,
          the Maker is wise and he understands this. They are infidels as he calls
          them, and the Circles are no place for those who are not devout to the
          Veil. The Maker\u2019s hand was forced, he had no \\n\\n  \\n  I am in
          no place to question our great Maker, centuries of experience guide his
          choices,"
    - rid: 8910043462656589944
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
