    - rid: 8910043462656589953
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "he has faced this scourge before and defeated it, faced the Fallen
          and bested them, sealed them, he created our Veil, invented our Beacon
          when we were all but on death's door, I am a lone researcher with barely
          a handful of breakthroughs to my name, I am a servant to our Maker and
          his Veil I \\n\\n  I can not help but consider different solutions, we
          could have studied it \u2013 we were studying it. Administering fluids
          slowed it down, given the chance we could have isolated them in one of
          the lower circles and given them dosages "
    - rid: 8910043462656589954
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
