    - rid: 8910043462656589963
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "to keep them alive\u2026 but we would be wasting resources on Infidels
          non believers\u2026 but we are doctors, are we not? Before research our
          duty is to cure.  I could not have prevented it, this is not my fault,
          there was nothing I could have done to prevent it, and why should I prevent
          it? The Makers word is just. "
