        m_Value: 25
    - rid: 8910043462656589983
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: There is a stark difference between watching a corpse burn and watching
          someone squirm and scream and eventually give in when the flames begin
          to lick their heels. I did not know the little boy who the Keepers tied
          to a pyre, I did not know his mother who willingly handed him to them,
          I did not know his father who was also taken when he begged them to not
          burn his son alive. What I did know was that I could have kept him alive
          for some time, long enough that his father would have watched him experience
          his childhood before death. \n\n
