    - rid: 8910043462656590025
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.Int32, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 30
    - rid: 8910043462656590026
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "where information of the Maker\u2019s time is chronicled. My current
          standing does not authorise me to do so, but I needed to know if there
          is even a speck of information that can benefit the course of our current
          treatments. Unfortunately, I do not quite understand what I saw. I did
          not bring anything back with me, that would be ridiculous, but I did copy
          some of the things I saw there. A lot of it were symbols, their intent
          or use remains a mystery to me. Scrolls were filled with them, either together
          or apart. I believe the passages written along them are encrypted with
          some sort of code,"
    - rid: 8910043462656590027
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
