    - rid: 8910043595238277283
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "Forgive me, Veil I beg of you shield me, guide me and forgive me,
          forgive me\u2026\\n\\n   I am tainted, filth runs through my veins. Have
          you abandoned me? The lack of your presence erodes my flesh, I have become
          a disgusting thing, a rough maimed image of a human being. Where have I
          strayed? I only wished to please you. \\n\\n"
