    - rid: 8910043595238277327
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 'Is this the punishment I reap for my arrogance? For thinking I
          knew better than our great Maker? I do not wish to die cast away from your
          grace. Forgive me, I beg of you, cleanse me. Do I not deserve such benignity
          after my betrayal? Am I like the rest of them now, those whose fate is
          to be tied to a pyre and purged to please you? Would that please you? '
