    - rid: 8910043595238277336
      type: {class: EnumConstant, ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value:
          m_EnumType:
            m_Identification: BookGraph.Runtime.PageEffect, Assembly-CSharp, Version=0.0.0.0,
              Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
          m_Value: 1
        m_EnumType:
          m_Identification: BookGraph.Runtime.PageEffect, Assembly-CSharp, Version=0.0.0.0,
            Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
    - rid: 8910043595238277337
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.Int32, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 37
    - rid: 8910043595238277338
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: The land outside the Circles is dead. The power needed to banish
          the Old Gods was fueled on its very essence, draining it to form the desert
          stretching far into the horizon. Perhaps the Veil still guides me, for
          I found shelter. I met a man a few hours after walking under the scorching
          sun. He introduced himself as Jasper, I have no doubt that he was a Husk.
          He appeared human, but only in a way that seemed like an act. In moments
          where I looked a little closer, I noticed that occasionally his mouth would
          not move when he spoke.
    - rid: 8910043595238277339
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
