    - rid: 8910043595238277346
      type: {class: EnumConstant, ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value:
          m_EnumType:
            m_Identification: BookGraph.Runtime.PageEffect, Assembly-CSharp, Version=0.0.0.0,
              Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
          m_Value: 1
        m_EnumType:
          m_Identification: BookGraph.Runtime.PageEffect, Assembly-CSharp, Version=0.0.0.0,
            Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
    - rid: 8910043595238277347
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.Int32, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: 38
    - rid: 8910043595238277348
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: He had an off-putting smile carved on his face when he pointed in
          the direction of this shack. When I thanked him he simply laughed and threw
          a satchel my way.\n\n  To think that I would stoop so low that I am desperate
          enough to accept help from a Husk. I am far from the Beacon's light now.
          I packed enough fluids to administer for a week. I need to keep them safe,
          the sun is harsh. Is it even worth living here for a week? I could have
          stayed and died under the Beacons light, but the Maker would have seen
          my shame.\n\n
    - rid: 8910043595238277349
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
