    - rid: 8910043595238277358
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "I would have been burned, made to be an example like the rest of
          the infidels\u2026 It is hard to accept that this is what I am considered
          now, a non-beliver.\\n\\n  I think back to the boy they set alight, barely
          seven. Was he, innocent as he was, not worthy of the Veil\u2019s protection?
          This shack is my own pyre, I do not want to die here. "
    - rid: 8910043595238277359
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
