    - rid: 8910043595238277432
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: I hear water. Rivers rushing through the silence, droplets hitting
          a serene pond rippling across the crevices of my brain, waves oscillating
          in a hypnotic pattern slowly eroding bone. There is a crack somewhere in
          my skull, where the waves squeeze through and pour down to my spine. It
          echoes through my flesh, a sickening coolness crashing through my body,
          reverberating in specific increments like a pendulum. It is trying to show
          me home. I have seen it in my mind's eye when the waves engulf me and drag
          me down to drown, the smallest tear in the Veil. It exists beyond;
    - rid: 8910043595238277433
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
