    - rid: 8910043595238277442
      type: {class: 'Constant`1[[System.String, mscorlib]]', ns: Unity.GraphToolkit.Editor, asm: Unity.GraphToolkit.Internal.Editor}
      data:
        m_Value: "the distance to this tear seems to be growing shorter every day.\\n\\n 
          It\u2026 wants me to go somewhere, that much I have concluded. It wants
          water, the basin was not enough. I must drown.\\n\\n   The lines between
          us have begun to blur\u2026 I know you walk in my flesh when my mind rests,
          you want to take me somewhere, you want us to become one. You yearn for
          a body so badly, so desperate it is pathetic. Do you even know what you
          are? You who has no identity, no soul."
    - rid: 8910043595238277443
      type: {class: DefaultPage, ns: BookGraph.Editor, asm: Assembly-CSharp-Editor}
      data: 
